{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/453432-what-would-you-do-with-the-father-s-form","id":453432,"title":"What would you do with The Father's Form","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-22T17:42:23-07:00","id":453432,"title":"What would you do with The Father's Form","content":"So the Father's Form is an interesting enough Gift Facet that it got a blurb alongside other important concepts in the game like cannibalism and totem spirits. Instead of the paltry paragraph or two that the other game concepts got, though, it got a almost two dedicated pages (counting the big art piece).<br /> <br /> So what would you do with the Father's Form? I suggested my pack's Cahilith take it to sleep in so as to super-charge his dreams.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4563-terraben","name":"TerraBen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"278"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-22T17:54:11-07:00","id":453458,"title":"","content":"While I certainly wouldn't say I hate the idea, I'm part of the group mentioned in the second paragraph of the first page. I wouldn't pick the gift, but I appreciate that it's available for others to have. I can't imagine what I'd use it for that I wouldn't use regular Gauru for, except maybe to appear big and threatening in a way the other forms don't in order to intimidate someone.<br /> <br /> It seems like a good option considering how many people wanted to be able to sit around in Gauru form without fighting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-22T18:17:34-07:00","id":453476,"title":"","content":"I'd use it for rituals, particularly those pertaining to the nature of uratha.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-23T00:01:13-07:00","id":453922,"title":"","content":"Use the Father's Form for:<ul><li>Reaching things on the top shelf.</li> <li>Pushing stalled vehicles out of traffic.</li> <li>Spotting your packmates on the free weights.</li> <li>Costume contests.</li> <li>Saving seats for your friends at the movies.</li> <li>Rearranging the furniture.</li> <li>Awesome cannonballs at the pool.</li> <li>Finding pants that won't rip when you change shape.</li> </ul>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>LFP: Foreign Bodies (Deviant: the Renegades)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/969-verge","name":"Verge","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"378"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-23T00:09:08-07:00","id":453932,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Verge</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/453432-what-would-you-do-with-the-father-s-form?p=453922#post453922\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Use the Father's Form for:<ul><li>Reaching things on the top shelf.</li> <li>Pushing stalled vehicles out of traffic.</li> <li>Spotting your packmates on the free weights.</li> <li>Costume contests.</li> <li>Saving seats for your friends at the movies.</li> <li>Rearranging the furniture.</li> <li>Awesome cannonballs at the pool.</li> <li>Finding pants that won't rip when you change shape.</li> </ul></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Don't forget &quot;free costume for Halloween.&quot; <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","name":"branford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar618_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1904"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-23T09:22:23-07:00","id":454460,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbc