dial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-09T20:07:20-07:00","id":475253,"title":"","content":"Does Gauru lack genetalia like the Crinos of apocalypse? I know in apocalypse the war form lacks all genetalia, save for when birthing metis (where it becomes something of a necessity). Hell one of the opening chapters (i think hammer and klaive) has an elder full on nut a cub, knowing full well it wont actually do anything (as much as getting kicked by an 800 pound war beast would) but in his mind he anticipates said nut pains and so &quot;cripples&quot; himself mentally. Dunno if it works that way in Gauru or not, considering it has been alluded to in the first editions that Gauru was the &quot;true&quot; uratha form.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-09T20:12:46-07:00","id":475280,"title":"","content":"Oh no, you still have naughty bits. You can makes the sweet, sweet love with Father